# git command orphans. When git-amend / git-push were demoted from skills to
# commands and later dropped altogether, .chezmoiremove named only the skill
# paths (.claude/skills/git-*) -- the command files under .claude/commands/git/
# were never pointed at, and that directory is not exact_, so nothing pruned
# them. git/undo is from the same era. All three survived the 2026-08-03 orphan
# sweep for the same reason: source-side greps cannot see files that exist only
# on the machine. They still carry disable-model-invocation, so leaving them
# would make the model-invocability spec's inventory false on any machine that
# has them.
.claude/commands/git/amend.md
.claude/commands/git/push.md
.claude/commands/git/undo.md

# starship 的設定檔搬回 ~/.config/starship.toml（starship 唯一的預設路徑）。
